WEBVTT

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:55.530
{missing}

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:56.700
Don't try to escape!

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.800
Stop!

00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.190
{missing}

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.660
You can't escape from here.

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:22.490
Don't do it!

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:30.270
I'm increasing the power!

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:35.510
What are you doing?

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:45.860
We're punishing the villains 
who ditched work and ran away.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.620
Let them go!

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:51.590
We can't do that.

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.270
You look like a duelist.

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.560
That means this town will welcome you.

00:01:56.890 --> 00:02:00.880
If you have dueling skills, 
you can earn a lot of money.

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:22.280
I came to this town for a reason.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.580
It's not to make money.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:28.460
I'm here to get back a friend.

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:52.310
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:57.850
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:02:57.850 --> 00:03:02.430
Don't look back and keep going

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:08.090
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:13.130
There's no need to fear

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:20.770
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:26.910
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:32.550
Streak to the infinite future

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:38.140
Dreams surpass their limits

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:46.060
And will lead you to a bright place

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:17.890
Crash Town

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.050
Dear Yusei Fudo,

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:32.860
I'm writing this letter because 
I heard you're friends with him.

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:36.180
Please save him.

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:39.010
Please take him away from this town.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:44.050
If things don't change, he'll 
be killed in this town.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:54.660
You ride a D-Wheel?

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:57.790
An enthusiastic boy has arrived.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:59.400
Want to give it a go?

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:04.240
Sorry, but I only duel against duelists.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:04.910
What?

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.770
Those are strong words.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:13.250
But the more arrogant you are, 
the quicker you go to hell.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:14.460
Go to hell?

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.610
That's right.

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.220
Before you know it, you're 
surrounded by demons.

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:22.690
Enthusiastic boy, show us your skills.

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:24.930
Stop!

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.330
It isn't duel time yet.

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:30.660
You're breaking the laws of Crash Town!

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:35.830
I don't want to gather flowers 
for a funeral anymore.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.740
I called him here.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:41.540
You?

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:44.780
I wrote the letter.  I'm Barbara.

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:57.580
Your letter said that you want 
me to save him from this town.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.460
Yes.

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:05.210
I understand.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.870
This is a dangerous town.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:11.880
When the sun sets, the town 
becomes even more dangerous.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:39.730
The gang wearing the red 
scarves is the Malcolm Family.

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:43.300
Their sneering leader is Malcolm.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:47.160
Facing them is the Ramon Group.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:50.920
That thin man is their leader, Ramon.

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:53.640
What's going to happen?

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.230
You'll know soon enough.

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:56.650
Watch.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.320
I'm counting on you, master.

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:07.950
If you defeat him, I'll give 
you as much money as you want.

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:15.570
Which of you is the cheater 
who keeps winning?

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:22.200
Everyone talks tough before a duel begins.

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:25.540
They don't realize it'll be 
their precious final words.

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.450
I'm counting on you, master!

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:09.450
Kiryu!

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:15.230
At dusk, duel time lasts until the 
sun vanishes below the horizon.

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:18.740
One of them will vanish 
along with the setting sun.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:22.700
Is this how Kiryu is going 
to be killed in this town?

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:25.470
You'll find out in this duel.

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:35.770
Duel!

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:43.780
I'll go first.

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:55.090
Kiryu...

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.460
My turn.  I draw.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:21.780
I summon Infernity Mirage.

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:28.090
I set one card and end my turn.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.400
Kiryu is acting strange.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.180
His soul isn't facing the duelist.

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:37.680
Right.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:42.120
He came to this town because 
he's looking for a place to die.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:44.770
This town reeks of death.

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:46.870
Reeks of death?

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:49.000
It all started when...

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:53.580
We learned that mountain 
contained a mineral named Dyne,

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:57.260
which is needed to build D-Wheel parts.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:04.660
Like a gold rush, many people 
arrived and built this town.

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:09.690
Malcolm and Ramon took 
control of the mountain.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:15.210
They competed for workers to dig the mineral.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:20.970
In the end, they decided to 
compete for workers by dueling.

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:22.570
By dueling?

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:27.780
Dueling ruled the town.

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:32.110
If you win a duel, you receive lots of money.

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:36.870
Therefore, skilled duelists 
came to this town.

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:39.890
What about the losers?

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.520
My turn!

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:52.140
I summon Illegal Keeper!

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:56.770
Card Destruction.

00:11:56.770 --> 00:12:01.530
After both players discard their hands, they 
draw the same number of cards that they discarded.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:06.560
With Illegal Keeper, if he draws cards 
other than during the Draw Phase...

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:10.380
..they return to his deck, and 
he takes 1000 points of damage.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.180
I'll take away 1000 points in an instant!

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:14.750
And then I'll attack him!

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:17.720
I activate the spell card Card Destruction!

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:21.580
You have to discard your entire hand.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.560
Then you draw the same number of cards!

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:26.300
I flip over the trap card Full Salvo.

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:29.900
I send my entire hand to 
the graveyard, and you take

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:33.960
200 points of damage for 
every card that I discarded.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:37.040
I discarded cards quicker than you.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.640
I have no cards in my hand.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:49.120
Therefore, I don't take 
Card Destruction's effect.

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.830
That's Kiryu's special handless combo!

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:59.360
Since I have no cards in my hand, 
I can release Infernity Mirage

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:03.800
to Special Summon two Infernity 
monsters from my graveyard.

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:08.540
Come, Infernity Archfiend 
and Infernity Destroyer!

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:16.110
Damn!  My monster doesn't 
have enough attack points!

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:17.250
I end my turn.

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:19.250
My turn.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:22.720
I activate Infernity Burst from my hand.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:28.730
For every Infernity monster on my 
field, you take 800 points of damage.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:37.770
Next, Infernity Destroyer 
attacks Illegal Keeper.

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:51.200
When Infernity Destroyer destroys a monster 
when I have zero cards in my hand,

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.650
you take 1600 points of damage.

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:56.940
This is the handless combo...

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:10.900
Don't do this!

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:31.020
The loser must work for the 
winning side, and he'll live

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:32.980
in the mountain for the rest of his life.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:38.380
He'll never escape from the hellish 
darkness of that mountain.

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:48.700
Those were people sent to the 
mountain after losing a duel.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.930
What happened to Kiryu?

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:55.410
He...

00:14:56.320 --> 00:15:02.650
Kiryu is using this town to commit suicide.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:06.720
Kiryu...

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:17.200
Thanks.  He had no dueling skills, 
but he looked like a hard worker.

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:19.240
That's why you're the master.

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:20.670
That's your 50th consecutive victory.

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:21.880
Dammit, Ramon!

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:23.230
I'll get you next time!

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:26.410
I'll send you and that punk to the mountain!

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:28.980
Try your best.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:39.420
Kiryu!

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:44.260
Kiryu!

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:54.420
Kiryu, why won't you answer me?

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.010
Damn!

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:18.400
How dare Ramon make a fool out of me!

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:20.600
Boss, you shouldn't drink too much.

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:21.730
Shut up!

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:24.960
You're all useless!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:32.100
If my younger brother Lawton came home 
right now, that punk Kiryu would be...

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.600
He'd beat him with a single attack!

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:36.160
Hey.

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:38.440
Who are you?

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:40.400
You're...

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:41.450
From before!

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:44.730
Hire me.

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:49.040
Bring it on, punk!

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:51.020
We'll be your opponents!

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:56.160
Fine.  I'll see how skilled you are.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.800
If I like you, I'll hire you.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:01.400
If I don't like you, you 
won't leave unscathed.

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:03.560
Let's hurry up and begin.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:04.500
You can all fight me.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.480
Duel!

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:17.200
I'll go first!

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.540
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:23.400
I summon the Tuner Monster Changer 
Synchron in defense position!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.720
I set one card and end my turn!

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:29.350
My turn!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:32.700
I summon Fuse Ray Blaster.

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:38.160
Due to battle royale rules, neither 
of us can attack on the first turn.

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:39.440
I end my turn.

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:42.170
My turn.

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:45.540
I summon Fuse Ray Blaster!

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:48.380
Shooting!

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:54.380
When Fuse Ray Blaster is in attack position,

00:17:54.380 --> 00:18:00.230
if another Fuse Ray Blaster is summoned, 
you take 800 points of damage.

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:03.690
I end my turn.

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:06.110
My turn!

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:09.430
I summon Fuse Ray Blaster!

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.860
Shooting!

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:20.540
I end my turn.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:22.830
We have plenty of bullets...

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.440
...remaining!

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:29.770
My turn!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:36.060
In order to rescue Kiryu, 
you must defeat him.

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:40.110
When he loses and is free of the Ramon 
Group's control, that's our chance.

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:45.300
We'll grab him before those 
men take him to the mountain.

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:50.870
I send one monster card in 
my hand to the graveyard.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:54.860
That lets me Special Summon the Tuner 
Monster Quickdraw Synchron from my hand!

00:18:57.270 --> 00:19:03.420
When a Tuner Monster is on my field, I can 
Special Summon Quillbolt Hedgehog from my graveyard!

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:07.690
Level 5 Quickdraw Synchron tunes 
Level 2 Quillbolt Hedgehog!

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:11.400
Our thoughts combine to 
call forth a new power!

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:13.070
Become that path that lights the way!

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.660
Synchro Summon!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:17.480
Burn up, Nitro Warrior!

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:21.740
Then I summon Gauntlet Warrior!

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:26.700
Level 1 Changer Synchron tunes 
Level 3 Gauntlet Warrior!

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:30.680
Synchro Summon!

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:33.240
Come, Armory Arm!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:39.680
Due to the effect of Changer Synchron 
that was sent to the graveyard,

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:43.670
your Fuse Ray Blaster switches 
to defense position!

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:46.890
Next, I activate Armory Arm's effect!

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:52.630
By equipping this card on Nitro Warrior, 
Nitro Warrior gains 1000 attack points!

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:54.600
3800?

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:58.900
From my hand, I equip the Equip 
Spell Junk Barrage on Nitro Warrior!

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:08.880
Since I activate a spell card this turn, 
it gains 1000 attack points for one battle!

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:13.780
I'll bury all three of you this turn!

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:16.380
Go, Nitro Warrior!

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:17.800
Dynamite Knuckle!

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:25.940
No way!

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:33.700
Why?

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.040
When Nitro Warrior destroys a monster,

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:41.010
it can switch a monster from defense to 
attack position and continue to attack.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:46.170
And with Armory Arm's effect, when the 
equipped monster destroys a monster in battle,

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:49.080
you take damage equal to that 
monster's attack points.

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:51.950
Then due to the Equip Spell Junk Barrage,

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:55.690
you take damage equal to half the 
destroyed monster's attack points.

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:00.130
I flip over my trap card Synchro Overlimit!

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:06.600
A Synchro Monster that destroyed your 
monster in battle can battle again this turn!

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:07.970
No way!

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:09.940
Dynamite Knuckle!

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:14.160
Armory Arm and Junk Barrage's 
effects activate!

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:29.290
Three people in one turn?

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:31.900
One turn, three kill!

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:34.560
He's incredible!

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:41.400
You might be able to defeat Kiryu!

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:44.060
But I'm rare.

00:21:45.350 --> 00:21:47.080
My fee will be expensive.

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:13.960
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:13.960 --> 00:22:18.840
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:18.840 --> 00:22:23.780
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:23.780 --> 00:22:28.790
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:28.790 --> 00:22:33.840
The cruel god tests us

00:22:33.840 --> 00:22:40.400
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:40.400 --> 00:22:44.470
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:44.470 --> 00:22:50.310
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:50.310 --> 00:22:54.400
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.400 --> 00:23:00.020
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.020 --> 00:23:03.200
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.200 --> 00:23:05.460
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:05.460 --> 00:23:09.990
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:12.960
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:12.960 --> 00:23:16.400
You want to party until the morning

00:23:16.400 --> 00:23:19.780
At our special place
